  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ARM: SME FINANCE PROGRAM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ADB extends debt facilities totaling up to $65 million to Armenian banks for on-lending to SMEs. ACBA Credit Agricole, Ameriabank, Ardshininvestbank, and Inecobank were selected to be the banks proposed to participate in the program based on their credit profiles, their willingness and ability to expand their SME portfolios, and ADB?s potential to add value under and beyond the program.</narrative>
  </description>
